# Both knobs at their ends, the lowest and highest notes (C0, C8), velocity 1 and 127, knob jumps on the same
# block as note-ons, a full bend on a top note, and the whisper end of P2.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 0 C8 4 127
param p1 0 4
param p2 0 4
note 4 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 1
param p1 255 8
param p2 191 8
note 8 C8 4 127
bend 8 200
note 8 C1 4 127
param p1 0 12
param p2 255 12
bend 12 -200
note 12 G7 4 127
note 12 C0 4 127
expect peak_below -2
